---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Confirmer sa présence" activePage="rsvp">
  <PageHeader title="Confirmer sa présence" />

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>Afin de mieux organiser ce week-end et de nous assurer que tout soit parfait pour vous accueillir, merci de confirmer votre présence <strong>avant le 30 juin 2026</strong>.</p>
        <p>Précisez-nous les jours où vous serez présents et si vous avez des besoins particuliers (régime alimentaire, etc.).</p>
        <p><strong>Nous avons hâte de célébrer avec vous !</strong></p>
        <p class="required-note">Les champs marqués d'un&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span> sont obligatoires.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="rsvp-form" id="rsvpForm">
        <!-- Informations générales -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Informations générales</h2>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Invités *</label>
            <p class="help-text">Ajoutez chaque personne concernée par cette réponse.</p>
            <div id="guestList"></div>
            <button type="button" id="addGuestBtn" class="btn-add-guest">+ Ajouter un invité</button>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Événements -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Je confirme ma/notre présence pour : *</h2>

          <div class="checkbox-group">
            <label class="checkbox-label">
              <input type="checkbox" name="events" value="vendredi">
              <span>Vendredi 2 octobre - Cérémonie hindoue et déjeuner</span>
            </label>
            <label class="checkbox-label">
              <input type="checkbox" name="events" value="samedi">
              <span>Samedi 3 octobre - Bénédiction à l'église, cocktail et réception</span>
            </label>
            <label class="checkbox-label">
              <input type="checkbox" name="events" value="dimanche">
              <span>Dimanche 4 octobre - Petit-déjeuner</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Régimes alimentaires -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Régimes alimentaires et allergies</h2>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="dietary">Végétarien, intolérance aux poissons/fruits de mer, autres allergies ?</label>
            <p class="help-text">Merci de préciser pour chaque personne concernée.</p>
            <textarea id="dietary" name="dietary" rows="3" placeholder="Ex : Marie - végétarienne, Lucas - intolérance aux fruits de mer"></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Participation active -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Participation à la chorale</h2>

          <p class="help-text">Nous cherchons des volontaires pour former une chorale durant la bénédiction à l'église.</p>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Seriez-vous intéressé(e) pour participer à la chorale ?&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
            <div class="radio-group">
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="chorale" value="oui">
                <span>Oui, avec plaisir !</span>
              </label>
              <div class="conditional-field" id="choraleQuiGroup" style="display:none;">
                <label for="chorale-qui">Qui est intéressé(e) ?&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="chorale-qui" name="chorale-qui" placeholder="Prénom(s)">
              </div>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="chorale" value="non">
                <span>Non, merci</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Êtes-vous musicien(ne) ?&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
            <div class="radio-group">
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="musician" value="oui">
                <span>Oui</span>
              </label>
              <div class="conditional-field" id="musicianDetailsGroup" style="display:none;">
                <div class="conditional-row">
                  <label for="musician-qui">Qui est musicien(ne) ?&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="musician-qui" name="musician-qui" placeholder="Prénom(s)">
                </div>
                <div class="conditional-row">
                  <label for="instrument">Instrument(s)&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="instrument" name="instrument" placeholder="Précisez">
                </div>
              </div>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="musician" value="non">
                <span>Non</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Transport -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Transport</h2>
          <p class="help-text">Si vous proposez ou cherchez un covoiturage, nous vous mettrons en relation avec d'autres invités.</p>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Covoiturage&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
            <div class="radio-group">
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="covoiturage" value="propose">
                <span>Je propose des places dans ma voiture</span>
              </label>
              <div class="conditional-field" id="proposeGroup" style="display:none;">
                <div class="conditional-row">
                  <label for="places">Nombre de places disponibles&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                  <input type="number" id="places" name="places" min="1" max="8">
                </div>
                <div class="conditional-row">
                  <label for="ville-propose">Ville de départ&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="ville-propose" name="ville-propose" placeholder="Ex : Paris">
                </div>
              </div>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="covoiturage" value="cherche">
                <span>Je cherche un covoiturage</span>
              </label>
              <div class="conditional-field" id="chercheGroup" style="display:none;">
                <label for="ville-cherche">Ville de départ&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="ville-cherche" name="ville-cherche" placeholder="Ex : Paris">
              </div>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="covoiturage" value="non-concerne">
                <span>Je ne suis pas concerné(e)</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service de garde -->
        <div class="form-section">
          <h2>Service de garde d'enfants</h2>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>Si une babysitter est mise à disposition pendant la soirée, seriez-vous intéressé(e) ?&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
            <div class="radio-group">
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="babysitter" value="oui">
                <span>Oui</span>
              </label>
              <div class="conditional-field" id="nbEnfantsGardeGroup" style="display:none;">
                <label for="nb-enfants-garde">Nombre d'enfants à garder&nbsp;<span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                <input type="number" id="nb-enfants-garde" name="nb-enfants-garde" min="1" max="10">
              </div>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="babysitter" value="non">
                <span>Non</span>
              </label>
              <label class="radio-label">
                <input type="radio" name="babysitter" value="non-concerne">
                <span>Je ne suis pas concerné(e)</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Error message -->
        <div class="form-message form-error" id="formError" style="display:none;"></div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Envoyer ma réponse</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <!-- Success message (outside form so form can be fully hidden) -->
      <div class="form-message form-success" id="formSuccess" style="display:none;">
        <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
        <h3>Merci !</h3>
        <p>Votre réponse a bien été enregistrée.</p>
        <p>Nous sommes ravis et avons hâte de célébrer ce moment unique avec vous.</p>
        <p class="success-signature">À très vite,<br><strong>Daphné &amp; Jean-Baptiste</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // Show/hide nb enfants à garder
  const babysitterRadios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="babysitter"]');
  const nbEnfantsGardeGroup = document.getElementById('nbEnfantsGardeGroup');
  babysitterRadios.forEach((radio) => {
    radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const val = (document.querySelector('input[name="babysitter"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (nbEnfantsGardeGroup) {
        nbEnfantsGardeGroup.style.display = val === 'oui' ? 'block' : 'none';
      }
    });
  });

  // Show/hide chorale qui
  const choraleRadios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="chorale"]');
  const choraleQuiGroup = document.getElementById('choraleQuiGroup');
  choraleRadios.forEach((radio) => {
    radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const val = (document.querySelector('input[name="chorale"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (choraleQuiGroup) {
        choraleQuiGroup.style.display = val === 'oui' ? 'block' : 'none';
      }
    });
  });

  // Show/hide covoiturage conditional blocks
  const covoiturageRadios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="covoiturage"]');
  const proposeGroup = document.getElementById('proposeGroup');
  const chercheGroup = document.getElementById('chercheGroup');
  covoiturageRadios.forEach((radio) => {
    radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const val = (document.querySelector('input[name="covoiturage"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (proposeGroup) proposeGroup.style.display = val === 'propose' ? 'block' : 'none';
      if (chercheGroup) chercheGroup.style.display = val === 'cherche' ? 'block' : 'none';
    });
  });

  // Show/hide musician details
  const musicianRadios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="musician"]');
  const musicianDetailsGroup = document.getElementById('musicianDetailsGroup');
  musicianRadios.forEach((radio) => {
    radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const val = (document.querySelector('input[name="musician"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (musicianDetailsGroup) {
        musicianDetailsGroup.style.display = val === 'oui' ? 'block' : 'none';
      }
    });
  });

  // Dynamic guest list
  const guestList = document.getElementById('guestList')!;
  const addGuestBtn = document.getElementById('addGuestBtn')!;
  let guestCount = 0;

  function createGuestRow() {
    guestCount++;
    const i = guestCount;
    const row = document.createElement('div');
    row.className = 'guest-row';
    row.dataset.index = String(i);
    row.innerHTML = `
      <div class="guest-row-header">
        <span class="guest-row-type-label">Adulte</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-remove-guest" title="Supprimer">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M12 4L4 12M4 4l8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="guest-row-fields">
        <div class="guest-field guest-field-type">
          <select name="guest-type-${i}" class="guest-type-select" required>
            <option value="adulte">Adulte</option>
            <option value="enfant">Enfant</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="guest-field guest-field-name">
          <input type="text" name="guest-prenom-${i}" required placeholder="Prénom">
        </div>
        <div class="guest-field guest-field-name">
          <input type="text" name="guest-nom-${i}" required placeholder="Nom">
        </div>
        <div class="guest-field guest-field-age" style="display:none;">
          <input type="number" name="guest-age-${i}" min="0" max="17" placeholder="Âge">
        </div>
        <div class="guest-field guest-field-menu" style="display:none;">
          <select name="guest-menu-${i}">
            <option value="">Menu</option>
            <option value="enfant">Menu enfant</option>
            <option value="adulte">Menu adulte</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    // Type change handler
    const typeSelect = row.querySelector('.guest-type-select') as HTMLSelectElement;
    const ageField = row.querySelector('.guest-field-age') as HTMLElement;
    const menuField = row.querySelector('.guest-field-menu') as HTMLElement;
    const ageInput = row.querySelector(`[name="guest-age-${i}"]`) as HTMLInputElement;
    const typeLabel = row.querySelector('.guest-row-type-label') as HTMLElement;

    typeSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const isChild = typeSelect.value === 'enfant';
      ageField.style.display = isChild ? 'flex' : 'none';
      menuField.style.display = 'none';
      typeLabel.textContent = isChild ? 'Enfant' : 'Adulte';
      row.classList.toggle('guest-row-child', isChild);
      if (!isChild) {
        ageInput.value = '';
      }
    });

    // Age change handler - show menu for 12-17
    ageInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
      const age = parseInt(ageInput.value) || 0;
      menuField.style.display = (age >= 12 && age <= 17) ? 'flex' : 'none';
    });

    // Remove button
    row.querySelector('.btn-remove-guest')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      row.remove();
      renumberGuests();
    });

    guestList.appendChild(row);
  }

  function renumberGuests() {
    // No-op: badges removed
  }

  addGuestBtn.addEventListener('click', createGuestRow);

  // Add first guest row by default
  createGuestRow();

  const form = document.getElementById('rsvpForm') as HTMLFormElement;
  const errorEl = document.getElementById('formError')!;
  const successEl = document.getElementById('formSuccess')!;

  function showError(msg: string) {
    errorEl.textContent = msg;
    errorEl.style.display = 'block';
    successEl.style.display = 'none';
    errorEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
  }

  const GOOGLE_SCRIPT_URL = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwV8Rz16CUuWFyTrnxe5kLieaNV7XccP_RhyLl_rPwfulC3glqqG-CX3uEVpDKFu54C/exec';

  if (form) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      errorEl.style.display = 'none';

      // Validation
      const guestRows = guestList.querySelectorAll('.guest-row');
      if (guestRows.length === 0) {
        showError('Veuillez ajouter au moins un invité.');
        return;
      }

      const events = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="events"]:checked');
      if (events.length === 0) {
        showError('Veuillez sélectionner au moins un événement.');
        return;
      }

      // Required radios
      const requiredRadios: { name: string; label: string }[] = [
        { name: 'chorale', label: 'la participation à la chorale' },
        { name: 'musician', label: 'si vous êtes musicien(ne)' },
        { name: 'covoiturage', label: 'le covoiturage' },
        { name: 'babysitter', label: 'le service de garde d\'enfants' },
      ];
      for (const r of requiredRadios) {
        if (!document.querySelector(`input[name="${r.name}"]:checked`)) {
          showError(`Veuillez répondre à la question sur ${r.label}.`);
          return;
        }
      }

      // Conditional required fields
      const choraleVal = (document.querySelector('input[name="chorale"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (choraleVal === 'oui' && !(document.getElementById('chorale-qui') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
        showError('Veuillez préciser qui est intéressé(e) par la chorale.');
        return;
      }
      const musicianVal = (document.querySelector('input[name="musician"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (musicianVal === 'oui') {
        if (!(document.getElementById('musician-qui') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
          showError('Veuillez préciser qui est musicien(ne).');
          return;
        }
        if (!(document.getElementById('instrument') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
          showError('Veuillez préciser le ou les instrument(s).');
          return;
        }
      }
      const covoitVal = (document.querySelector('input[name="covoiturage"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (covoitVal === 'propose') {
        if (!(document.getElementById('places') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
          showError('Veuillez indiquer le nombre de places disponibles.');
          return;
        }
        if (!(document.getElementById('ville-propose') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
          showError('Veuillez indiquer la ville de départ.');
          return;
        }
      }
      if (covoitVal === 'cherche' && !(document.getElementById('ville-cherche') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
        showError('Veuillez indiquer la ville de départ.');
        return;
      }
      const babysitterVal = (document.querySelector('input[name="babysitter"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
      if (babysitterVal === 'oui' && !(document.getElementById('nb-enfants-garde') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim()) {
        showError('Veuillez indiquer le nombre d\'enfants à garder.');
        return;
      }

      // Collect guest data
      const guests: any[] = [];
      guestRows.forEach((row) => {
        const idx = row.getAttribute('data-index');
        const type = (row.querySelector(`[name="guest-type-${idx}"]`) as HTMLSelectElement)?.value;
        const prenom = (row.querySelector(`[name="guest-prenom-${idx}"]`) as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
        const nom = (row.querySelector(`[name="guest-nom-${idx}"]`) as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
        const age = (row.querySelector(`[name="guest-age-${idx}"]`) as HTMLInputElement)?.value;
        const menu = (row.querySelector(`[name="guest-menu-${idx}"]`) as HTMLSelectElement)?.value;

        if (prenom && nom) {
          guests.push({ type, prenom, nom, age: age || '', menu: menu || '' });
        }
      });

      if (guests.length === 0) {
        showError('Veuillez remplir le prénom et nom de chaque invité.');
        return;
      }

      // Collect other fields
      const eventsArr = Array.from(events).map((el) => (el as HTMLInputElement).value);
      const dietary = (document.getElementById('dietary') as HTMLTextAreaElement)?.value || '';
      const chorale = (document.querySelector('input[name="chorale"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const choraleQui = (document.getElementById('chorale-qui') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const musician = (document.querySelector('input[name="musician"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const musicianQui = (document.getElementById('musician-qui') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const instrument = (document.getElementById('instrument') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const carpooling = (document.querySelector('input[name="covoiturage"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const villePropose = (document.getElementById('ville-propose') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const villeCherche = (document.getElementById('ville-cherche') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const ville = carpooling === 'propose' ? villePropose : carpooling === 'cherche' ? villeCherche : '';
      const carpoolSeats = (document.getElementById('places') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const babysitter = (document.querySelector('input[name="babysitter"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';
      const nbEnfantsGarde = (document.getElementById('nb-enfants-garde') as HTMLInputElement)?.value || '';

      const payload = {
        guests,
        events: eventsArr,
        dietary,
        chorale,
        choraleQui,
        musician,
        musicianQui,
        instrument,
        carpooling,
        ville,
        carpoolSeats,
        babysitter,
        nbEnfantsGarde
      };

      // Disable submit button
      const submitBtn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]') as HTMLButtonElement;
      if (submitBtn) {
        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        submitBtn.textContent = 'Envoi en cours...';
      }

      try {
        await fetch(GOOGLE_SCRIPT_URL, {
          method: 'POST',
          mode: 'no-cors',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'text/plain' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload)
        });

        // Hide intro + form, only show the success message
        form.style.display = 'none';
        document.querySelectorAll('.intro-text').forEach((el) => {
          (el as HTMLElement).style.display = 'none';
        });
        successEl.style.display = 'block';
        successEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
      } catch (err) {
        showError('Une erreur est survenue. Veuillez réessayer ou nous contacter directement.');
        if (submitBtn) {
          submitBtn.disabled = false;
          submitBtn.textContent = 'Envoyer ma réponse';
        }
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-content { padding: 80px 20px; }

  .rsvp-form { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .form-section {
    background: var(--color-white);
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-purple-light);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--color-lavender);
  }

  .form-section h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .form-group { margin-bottom: 25px; }

  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .form-group input[type="text"],
  .form-group textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-lavender);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(147, 136, 247, 0.15);
  }

  .form-group textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }

  .checkbox-group,
  .radio-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .checkbox-label,
  .radio-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .checkbox-label span,
  .radio-label span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .checkbox-label:hover,
  .radio-label:hover {
    background: var(--color-beige);
    border-color: var(--color-purple-light);
  }

  .checkbox-label input[type="checkbox"],
  .radio-label input[type="radio"] {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border: 2px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 5px;
    margin-right: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .radio-label input[type="radio"] {
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  .checkbox-label input[type="checkbox"]:checked,
  .radio-label input[type="radio"]:checked {
    background: var(--color-lavender);
    border-color: var(--color-lavender);
  }

  .checkbox-label input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 6px;
    top: 2px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 12px;
    border: solid white;
    border-width: 0 2.5px 2.5px 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .radio-label input[type="radio"]:checked::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 6px;
    top: 2px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 12px;
    border: solid white;
    border-width: 0 2.5px 2.5px 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .checkbox-label span,
  .radio-label span {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

